    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "22. Other Rules And Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "22.01",
    "summary": "The **(Aura)** marking denotes an ability that reaches models within a stated distance. Count the emitting model as within reach. Different auras can affect a unit together. Treat overlapping instances from the same aura as a single application to that unit.",
